{"strongs": "H8202", "word": "שָׁפָט", "translit": "sha.phat", "root": "שפח", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "he hath judged", "definition": "שָׁפָט proper name, masculine ( he hath judged ); — usually Σαφατ[θ] : 1. father of Elilsha 1Kgs 19:16 ; 1Kgs 19:19 ; 2Kgs 3:11 ; 2Kgs 6:31 . 2. prince of Simeon Num 13:5 . 3. grandson of Zerubbabel 1Chr 3:22 . 4. Gaddite chief 1Chr 5:12 ( Σαβατ , Σαφαμ [ν] ). 5. herdsman of David 1Chr 27:29 ( Σωφαν , A Σωφατ , ᵐ5 L Σαφατ ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8958')\">BDB8958</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8202')\">H8202</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8957')\">BDB8957</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8959')\">BDB8959</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שָׁפָט</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>he hath judged</highlight>); — usually <grk>Σαφατ[θ]</grk>: <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> father of Elilsha <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:16\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,16)\">1Kgs 19:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,19)\">1Kgs 19:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,11)\">2Kgs 3:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 6:31\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(12,6,31)\">2Kgs 6:31</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> prince of Simeon <ref ref=\"Num 13:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,5)\">Num 13:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> grandson of Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:22\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,22)\">1Chr 3:22</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> Gaddite chief <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,12)\">1Chr 5:12</ref>